1
00:02:03,707 --> 00:02:08,477
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com

2
00:02:19,183 --> 00:02:21,233
They caught the betrayer!

3
00:03:46,875 --> 00:03:48,835
Wow Dundar Bey.

4
00:03:49,907 --> 00:03:53,117
It turns out you are the betrayer huh?

5
00:04:04,880 --> 00:04:06,620
Betrayer!

6
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:34,952
Murderer! Murderer! You killed my son!
My son died because of you!

7
00:04:34,952 --> 00:04:40,372
Look at my face! How could you do that
to my son? How could you?!

8
00:04:40,925 --> 00:04:44,327
I will kill you!
I will choke you with my bare hands!

9
00:04:44,327 --> 00:04:48,367
Do you hear me? I will kill you
with my bare hands

10
00:04:54,915 --> 00:04:58,925
You killed my son!
You'll pay for this!

11
00:05:17,526 --> 00:05:19,726
Suleiman Shah...

12
00:05:20,672 --> 00:05:24,902
Great Suleiman Shah's son...

13
00:05:25,893 --> 00:05:28,743
Now look at him.

14
00:06:57,975 --> 00:06:59,405
It's over.

15
00:07:01,299 --> 00:07:02,919
It's over.

16
00:07:04,441 --> 00:07:06,301
It's over.

17
00:07:12,189 --> 00:07:13,419
It's over.

18
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:22,790
Ev.. ever... everything is over.

19
00:07:24,013 --> 00:07:27,153
They caught him.

20
00:07:29,248 --> 00:07:31,048
You couldn't...

21
00:07:32,381 --> 00:07:35,021
be a proper Bey, Dundar Bey!

22
00:07:36,609 --> 00:07:39,739
You led us to the cliff!

23
00:07:58,226 --> 00:08:00,756
Suleiman shah's son...

24
00:08:03,453 --> 00:08:06,353
Ertugrul Ghazi's brother...

25
00:08:09,929 --> 00:08:12,889
The experienced Kayı Bey...

26
00:08:15,777 --> 00:08:18,187
Dundar Bey.

27
00:08:40,303 --> 00:08:42,243
You betrayed...

28
00:08:44,574 --> 00:08:46,654
your own Bey...

29
00:08:47,587 --> 00:08:50,480
your own breed...

30
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:55,770
your own tent,
your own religion brothers and sisters.

31
00:08:57,346 --> 00:09:00,646
Now tell us every single thing.

32
00:09:05,703 --> 00:09:07,153
I wanted Kayıs...

33
00:09:09,693 --> 00:09:12,183
I wanted Kayıs to be good.

34
00:09:22,144 --> 00:09:24,984
I wanted these wars which
waste our children...

35
00:09:28,066 --> 00:09:30,306
to end.

36
00:09:30,492 --> 00:09:37,836
Are you telling me that you told our
plans to the enemy and...

37
00:09:37,836 --> 00:09:41,196
led us to their ambushes in order to
keep us safe, huh?

38
00:09:43,299 --> 00:09:45,119
Tell me!

39
00:09:46,862 --> 00:09:48,902
We were going to give
a few martyrs...

40
00:09:50,543 --> 00:09:53,273
but we would have saved the whole
community.

41
00:09:53,273 --> 00:09:55,683
At the cost of Bayhoca's blood, ha?

42
00:09:57,047 --> 00:09:59,247
At the cost of Bayhoca's blood ha?

43
00:09:59,247 --> 00:10:01,077
Savcı Bey!

44
00:10:09,986 --> 00:10:11,586
You shall sit down.

45
00:10:28,179 --> 00:10:30,819
I didn't do it on purpose of
getting Bayhoca killed.

46
00:10:41,253 --> 00:10:43,433
My intention was not that.

47
00:10:44,179 --> 00:10:46,109
With whom did you collaborated...

48
00:10:48,847 --> 00:10:51,657
to kill Kayı Bey?
Tell me.

49
00:10:54,403 --> 00:10:57,893
With all the enemies of Kayıs.

50
00:11:03,321 --> 00:11:05,471
Isn't this true Dündar!?

51
00:11:22,014 --> 00:11:23,974
Bring them.

52
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:55,320
Here...

53
00:11:57,401 --> 00:12:00,221
Here are your brothers.

54
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:11,680
Here are your fellows.

55
00:12:18,729 --> 00:12:20,609
Now tell me.

56
00:12:22,813 --> 00:12:25,247
We were in touch with Nicola.

57
00:12:25,247 --> 00:12:27,057
Louder!

58
00:12:30,262 --> 00:12:32,682
We were in touch with Nicola.

59
00:12:46,361 --> 00:12:50,961
This was your first chance.

60
00:12:55,295 --> 00:12:58,235
You told everything to Nicola.

61
00:12:58,235 --> 00:13:01,285
He knew every step of ours!

62
00:13:03,068 --> 00:13:05,028
Anything else?

63
00:13:06,113 --> 00:13:08,283
They wanted to get the housing documents.

64
00:13:10,176 --> 00:13:12,926
They wanted to disgrace you.

65
00:13:17,021 --> 00:13:22,361
We planned the Commander's arrival
to the tent with these two.

66
00:13:24,826 --> 00:13:29,466
This was your second chance.

67
00:13:32,072 --> 00:13:36,652
You let the infidel disgrace our tribe!

68
00:13:37,741 --> 00:13:39,741
Anything else?

69
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:41,530
Anything else?

70
00:13:47,192 --> 00:13:49,732
I worked with Togay, too.

71
00:13:58,133 --> 00:13:59,633
This was...

72
00:14:02,520 --> 00:14:05,270
your third chance!

73
00:14:11,426 --> 00:14:16,286
You worked with infidel Papa,
infidel Constantinie...

74
00:14:16,765 --> 00:14:20,235
and infidel Mongols!

75
00:14:21,949 --> 00:14:27,989
Now tell me. Is there any infidel
left you didn't work with?

76
00:16:01,743 --> 00:16:04,223
If your intention was good...

77
00:16:09,953 --> 00:16:13,183
you wouldn't have done such things...

78
00:16:19,403 --> 00:16:22,143
You cannot work withthe devil and...

79
00:16:24,857 --> 00:16:27,987
claim that your intention was good.

80
00:16:31,733 --> 00:16:34,483
You cannot spread Islam...

81
00:16:36,166 --> 00:16:39,136
while working with the infidel!

82
00:16:59,819 --> 00:17:05,799
You betrayed your Bey, your tent,
your community...

83
00:17:06,738 --> 00:17:09,418
and your religion!

84
00:17:09,970 --> 00:17:12,240
The penalty for this...

85
00:17:16,401 --> 00:17:18,411
is death.

86
00:17:39,172 --> 00:17:42,302
Pray for the last time.

87
00:17:44,227 --> 00:17:46,837
Then I'll kill you

88
00:18:08,413 --> 00:18:10,503
Thank you nephew.

89
00:18:17,232 --> 00:18:19,502
Take all three of them.

90
00:19:06,910 --> 00:19:10,180
Betrayer! Betrayer!

91
00:19:11,187 --> 00:19:13,607
Don't throw anything!

92
00:20:02,958 --> 00:20:05,808
Dündar!

93
00:20:08,082 --> 00:20:09,659
Stop Hazal Hatun!

94
00:20:09,659 --> 00:20:11,949
Dündar!!!

95
00:20:30,645 --> 00:20:34,345
How could you do this to us.

96
00:20:37,008 --> 00:20:42,068
You warned me, but I didn't listen to
you, Hatun.

97
00:20:42,333 --> 00:20:47,131
You have nothing to do with this.
You are innocent.

98
00:20:47,131 --> 00:20:49,431
Don't be afraid, nothing bad will
happen to you.

99
00:20:50,074 --> 00:20:52,724
- Don't cry.
- No, no, no.

100
00:20:54,455 --> 00:20:56,115
Go now.

101
00:20:57,014 --> 00:20:59,412
It's enough Hazal Hatun.

102
00:20:59,412 --> 00:21:03,572
Alps! Keep Hazal Hatun in the tent!

103
00:21:04,213 --> 00:21:05,713
Go now!

104
00:21:06,138 --> 00:21:07,968
Let's go!
Clear the way!

105
00:23:32,859 --> 00:23:38,629
Aygül, don't.
Don't make it harder.

106
00:23:40,042 --> 00:23:43,482
Boran, get out of the way.

107
00:23:44,364 --> 00:23:47,254
I have something to tell him.

108
00:23:48,439 --> 00:23:49,719
Sister.

109
00:23:53,894 --> 00:23:56,214
Let me freshen up my heart.

110
00:24:23,376 --> 00:24:27,176
Boran Alp, can I stay alone with my
daughter?

111
00:24:31,168 --> 00:24:32,718
Father.

112
00:24:37,812 --> 00:24:39,752
Daughter.

113
00:24:40,341 --> 00:24:43,331
I am not your daughter.

114
00:24:43,936 --> 00:24:49,336
You were my father when you made
me marry to Alisar by force!

115
00:24:49,403 --> 00:24:54,256
You were my father when you caused
my brother's death with your faults!

116
00:24:54,256 --> 00:24:58,108
You were my father even when you
married to my mother's murderer!

117
00:24:58,108 --> 00:25:02,898
But now you are not my father!
You are a betrayer!

118
00:25:02,936 --> 00:25:05,846
- Aygül, Aygül...
- You are a betrayer, you are a betrayer!

119
00:25:05,846 --> 00:25:06,809
You...

120
00:25:10,567 --> 00:25:13,221
- Daughter...
- I am not your daughter!

121
00:25:13,221 --> 00:25:16,214
You betrayed our tribe!

122
00:25:16,214 --> 00:25:19,297
You deserved to die!

123
00:25:19,297 --> 00:25:21,317
I am not your daughter!

124
00:25:22,648 --> 00:25:24,158
Aygül.

125
00:25:34,902 --> 00:25:36,242
Aygül.

126
00:25:44,762 --> 00:25:46,222
Daughter.

127
00:25:46,982 --> 00:25:48,462
Daughter.

128
00:25:50,965 --> 00:25:53,165
Ah, daughter.

129
00:25:54,116 --> 00:25:55,486
Daughter.

130
00:26:00,571 --> 00:26:03,401
Forgive your father, daughter.

131
00:26:04,891 --> 00:26:06,851
forgive me.

132
00:26:13,955 --> 00:26:17,467
They went... they went silent.

133
00:26:17,467 --> 00:26:22,157
Osman must be talking with Beys
about how they'll kill Dundar.

134
00:26:29,543 --> 00:26:32,053
The betrayal is visible now.

135
00:26:33,821 --> 00:26:38,781
The betrayer accepted the accusations.

136
00:26:46,032 --> 00:26:48,012
The tradition is clear.

137
00:26:50,995 --> 00:26:55,085
Dundar Bey must be...

138
00:26:57,266 --> 00:26:59,566
executed without any delay.

139
00:27:01,375 --> 00:27:04,025
I want to do it Osman Bey.

140
00:27:05,635 --> 00:27:07,775
Pass it on me.

141
00:27:17,326 --> 00:27:19,076
Brother...

142
00:27:20,008 --> 00:27:22,398
this is not an individual issue.

143
00:27:24,515 --> 00:27:27,365
This concerns the whole Kayı Tribe.

144
00:27:32,644 --> 00:27:34,624
Alps will...

145
00:27:36,204 --> 00:27:38,254
do the execution.

146
00:27:38,750 --> 00:27:40,500
According to tradition...

147
00:27:40,709 --> 00:27:43,689
He'll be choked by bow string.

148
00:27:48,140 --> 00:27:53,600
Savcı my son, everybody suffered.

149
00:27:54,213 --> 00:27:58,453
Each family has a martyr.

150
00:27:58,983 --> 00:28:01,863
Let them end him...

151
00:28:02,339 --> 00:28:06,929
so his greed shall go under soil.

152
00:28:08,482 --> 00:28:10,612
This is going to be done with sunrise.

153
00:28:12,256 --> 00:28:15,336
What are we going to do with
Dundar Bey's wealth, my Bey?

154
00:28:15,958 --> 00:28:18,778
The betrayer's wealth is given away
to the community.

155
00:28:19,134 --> 00:28:21,234
What about Hazal Hatun?

156
00:28:23,204 --> 00:28:25,304
She's going to get her share.

157
00:28:25,947 --> 00:28:30,767
Not much, not less, just her share.

158
00:28:33,327 --> 00:28:34,597
Aygül...

159
00:28:36,421 --> 00:28:38,391
She is a daughter of a Bey, Osman Bey.

160
00:28:38,919 --> 00:28:41,559
She should also have her share.

161
00:28:42,674 --> 00:28:45,454
Isn't she going to get her share
from her father's wealth?

162
00:28:46,941 --> 00:28:52,811
Also, her son Kayı Alp should
get his share

163
00:29:03,542 --> 00:29:05,937
Everyone will get their share.

164
00:29:05,937 --> 00:29:07,957
The rules of the religion are clear.

165
00:29:09,930 --> 00:29:13,030
We'll take over the undeserved gain.

166
00:29:15,531 --> 00:29:19,211
Aygül is my sister.

167
00:29:20,233 --> 00:29:21,863
She is my precious one.

168
00:29:24,037 --> 00:29:27,337
She doesn't need the wealth which
was gained unfairly.

169
00:29:28,511 --> 00:29:30,451
After she gets her share...

170
00:29:33,106 --> 00:29:35,246
I'll be responsible for her well being.

171
00:29:40,128 --> 00:29:42,178
Eyvallah (okay) Osman Bey.

172
00:29:42,696 --> 00:29:47,346
Okay then sons, these days will pass.

173
00:29:47,720 --> 00:29:49,910
These days will pass.

174
00:29:51,858 --> 00:29:53,458
Osman Bey.

175
00:30:36,164 --> 00:30:38,844
Send Hazal Hatun to his father's.

176
00:30:42,290 --> 00:30:44,700
To his brother Yavlak Arslan.

177
00:30:47,584 --> 00:30:50,354
This is your duty Bala Hatun.

178
00:30:52,904 --> 00:31:00,734
Do not let her get away with
any of the orphans' share.

179
00:31:02,318 --> 00:31:04,339
Don't worry my Bey.

180
00:31:04,339 --> 00:31:06,559
I'll do what is necessary.

181
00:31:50,112 --> 00:31:55,722
Lord Nicola betrayed not only you,
but also Geyhatu.

182
00:31:55,805 --> 00:32:00,935
Nicola has a venomous tongue just like
a snkae has a venomous tooth.

183
00:32:01,898 --> 00:32:04,078
I'll make him eat his own tongue.

184
00:32:04,896 --> 00:32:07,406
No doubts, Togay.

185
00:32:07,785 --> 00:32:11,705
Now, a new duty is waiting for you.

186
00:32:12,269 --> 00:32:14,849
Geyhatu's duties haven't finished.

187
00:32:16,946 --> 00:32:19,776
Geyhatu himself assagined you
this new duty.

188
00:32:40,548 --> 00:32:44,168
Han of the Hans Geyhatu wants me to
collect the taxes...

189
00:32:44,168 --> 00:32:48,488
that Lords didn't pay to Seljuqs.

190
00:32:48,943 --> 00:32:53,443
Our herds perished after the epidemic.
We need more taxes to gain strenght...

191
00:32:53,487 --> 00:32:58,807
and we need more sheep and cows that
are healthy, protected from the epidcemic.

192
00:32:58,893 --> 00:33:03,613
Or our state will be in a trouble.

193
00:33:04,444 --> 00:33:09,204
Osman.
Isn't he a bigger threat?

194
00:33:09,444 --> 00:33:14,584
This is why I am giving you
more authorization.

195
00:33:49,174 --> 00:33:54,184
I will send you huge armies under
your command.

196
00:33:55,289 --> 00:34:00,959
You'll collect taxes from Turkish tents
and all the Lords.

197
00:34:01,344 --> 00:34:05,264
You'll crush those who don't pay!

198
00:34:08,864 --> 00:34:13,074
Now go and come back
with caravans loaded gold to the gills!

199
00:34:19,292 --> 00:34:26,322
Osman's and Nicola's heads are
already yours!

200
00:34:45,484 --> 00:34:48,952
The archers in Yarhisar and Bilecik
are going to...

201
00:34:48,952 --> 00:34:51,062
attack simultaneously.

202
00:34:51,084 --> 00:34:54,724
How are they going to get out
of there ailve? They'll die!

203
00:34:54,974 --> 00:34:56,844
You may be right.

204
00:34:58,121 --> 00:35:03,321
Our soldiers will attack bravely,
and die as a hero, Kalanoz.

205
00:35:03,649 --> 00:35:07,939
And that way, they'll be awarded
with the heaven of Jesus.

206
00:35:08,277 --> 00:35:15,187
This will save us time. Isn't it worth to
sacrifice soldiers for such a great victory?

207
00:35:16,700 --> 00:35:18,820
It surely does.

208
00:35:24,492 --> 00:35:27,552
You are learning politics, Kalanoz.

209
00:35:32,583 --> 00:35:34,003
Helen?

210
00:35:36,198 --> 00:35:38,909
It's like your body is soul-free.
You are pale.

211
00:35:38,909 --> 00:35:42,129
- Dündar escaped.
- How can he?!

212
00:35:42,129 --> 00:35:45,292
He killed one of our soldiers
and dressed as him, then escaped.

213
00:35:45,292 --> 00:35:48,499
The gold is gone!
We need the gold!

214
00:35:48,499 --> 00:35:51,329
Damn the gold!

215
00:35:52,289 --> 00:35:54,819
Tunnels!

216
00:35:56,067 --> 00:35:58,007
Tunnels!

217
00:35:59,251 --> 00:36:02,051
Dundar didn't know about tunnels.

218
00:36:02,855 --> 00:36:06,775
Osman learned I killed potter Idris.

219
00:36:06,775 --> 00:36:10,365
- What else did he learn?
- Isn't this enough?

220
00:36:13,495 --> 00:36:16,735
Did he find out about Petrus?

221
00:36:17,098 --> 00:36:19,688
He just catched me so far.

222
00:36:19,688 --> 00:36:23,048
- Do you think he knows about the tunnels?
- I am not sure.

223
00:36:23,931 --> 00:36:31,591
Let me talk to Dundar. Let's see what
I am going to get out of his mouth.

224
00:36:34,876 --> 00:36:37,006
Melik.

225
00:36:37,579 --> 00:36:40,149
Melik was the one who saw Dundar
for the last time.

226
00:36:41,315 --> 00:36:44,995
Helen go to Sogut at once.

227
00:36:45,153 --> 00:36:49,623
See Melik and get information.

228
00:36:49,832 --> 00:36:51,302
Now.

229
00:36:51,302 --> 00:36:53,082
Yes sir.

230
00:37:04,716 --> 00:37:08,016
It's a miracle that we're still alive!

231
00:37:08,550 --> 00:37:12,110
We have to live until
we complete our duty.

232
00:37:13,234 --> 00:37:14,821
Do not forget this.

233
00:37:14,821 --> 00:37:16,231
Petrus!

234
00:37:17,159 --> 00:37:22,499
Do you think Osman will let us live
as he promised, huh?

235
00:37:22,926 --> 00:37:25,709
He wants to use us to the end.

236
00:37:25,709 --> 00:37:28,199
We did what we could!

237
00:37:28,766 --> 00:37:31,937
The last thing he's going to get
from us is our lives!

238
00:37:31,937 --> 00:37:34,687
What else can we do?

239
00:37:34,710 --> 00:37:36,272
Don't be so sure.

240
00:37:36,272 --> 00:37:39,672
What else can he learn from us?

241
00:37:42,717 --> 00:37:44,777
Tunnels.

242
00:38:17,321 --> 00:38:21,421
You're not taking anything you
didn't deserve.

243
00:38:34,358 --> 00:38:38,728
So you are the Hatun now, huh?

244
00:38:39,235 --> 00:38:42,744
Are you still talking?
Do you want to get yourself killed?

245
00:38:42,744 --> 00:38:44,354
Aygül stop.

246
00:38:44,936 --> 00:38:46,876
Let her piss off.

247
00:38:47,772 --> 00:38:52,582
If it wasn't for Osman Bey, I'd kill
her myself.

248
00:38:56,625 --> 00:39:01,563
Come Lena, come.
You are missing the feast!

249
00:39:01,563 --> 00:39:04,563
You must be praying because you didn't
end like your husband!

250
00:39:04,563 --> 00:39:07,065
You wouldn't live if you were
not a Hatun.

251
00:39:07,065 --> 00:39:09,280
Let go of me Bala!

252
00:39:09,280 --> 00:39:11,297
- Lena!
- Let go of me Bala!

253
00:39:11,297 --> 00:39:16,097
Lena stop!

254
00:39:16,125 --> 00:39:21,235
- Lena!
- Osman Bey has an order.

255
00:39:23,203 --> 00:39:28,363
None of you can harm me.

256
00:39:29,787 --> 00:39:33,677
We are not done yet, Hazal Hatun!

257
00:39:33,677 --> 00:39:34,677
Aygül!

258
00:39:37,117 --> 00:39:40,929
You'll see me everytimeyou breath!

259
00:39:40,929 --> 00:39:45,547
I'll make you pay for my mother
sooner or later!

260
00:39:45,547 --> 00:39:47,630
Aygül!

261
00:39:47,630 --> 00:39:50,937
I'll kill you if she doesn't!
Do you hear me!

262
00:39:50,937 --> 00:39:54,195
Hatuns!
Stop!

263
00:39:54,195 --> 00:39:56,225
Pull yourselves together!

264
00:40:26,076 --> 00:40:31,126
All of these was going to be yours
when your father and I was dead.

265
00:40:32,445 --> 00:40:35,525
Now you'll watch this is being
given to others.

266
00:40:43,369 --> 00:40:45,679
These were yours.

267
00:40:53,609 --> 00:40:56,759
I'd prefer being hungry...

268
00:41:00,545 --> 00:41:02,975
to having haram(unlawful) wealth.

269
00:41:08,667 --> 00:41:10,327
Alps.

270
00:41:14,873 --> 00:41:16,473
Take this away.

271
00:41:24,310 --> 00:41:27,420
You can take your share and leave.

272
00:41:34,170 --> 00:41:35,457
Let's go.

273
00:41:35,457 --> 00:41:39,047
Knowing that I won't see you again...

274
00:41:41,457 --> 00:41:47,217
knowing that I won't see your
faces again...

275
00:41:48,731 --> 00:41:52,161
is more important than the gold
you've taken.

276
00:41:59,147 --> 00:42:03,577
If you see us again, you'll not only
lose your gold.

277
00:42:03,727 --> 00:42:05,547
You should know that.

278
00:42:12,064 --> 00:42:13,774
Let's go.

279
00:42:13,855 --> 00:42:15,525
Let's go.

280
00:42:30,029 --> 00:42:32,379
Valiant Dundar Bey.

281
00:42:32,379 --> 00:42:35,239
So you were booed in your own tent.

282
00:42:36,402 --> 00:42:40,962
You disgraced yourself in front of
kids and everyone.

283
00:43:03,363 --> 00:43:05,393
So you are here.

284
00:43:05,925 --> 00:43:07,475
You are here.

285
00:43:09,793 --> 00:43:12,213
I'm going to death's door, right sons?

286
00:43:28,853 --> 00:43:33,213
What about Hazal Hatun?

287
00:43:34,351 --> 00:43:37,171
You'll learn.
Let's go.

288
00:43:41,644 --> 00:43:45,024
They'll kill Dündar, then it
will be our turn.

289
00:43:45,583 --> 00:43:50,463
I told you.
Osman is not done with us yet.

290
00:43:55,866 --> 00:44:00,086
Osman doesn't know about tunnels.
Dundar doesn't know either.

291
00:44:00,778 --> 00:44:03,568
Osman will be informed sooner or later.

292
00:44:05,514 --> 00:44:07,334
What are we going to do then?

293
00:44:10,224 --> 00:44:12,704
Are we going to keep on
serving Osman?

294
00:44:14,079 --> 00:44:16,151
Are we going to tell him everything?

295
00:44:16,151 --> 00:44:21,251
run with the hare and hunt with
the hounds. Our first mission...

296
00:44:22,882 --> 00:44:27,912
is not meeting our father in heaven.

297
00:44:30,098 --> 00:44:34,758
Our first mission is to send Osman
in hell!

298
00:44:36,196 --> 00:44:38,576
Do not forget it Simon!

299
00:44:39,797 --> 00:44:41,447
Never!

300
00:45:29,926 --> 00:45:31,856
Why isn't there anyone?

301
00:45:32,275 --> 00:45:34,925
Did you want to say your last
words to the community?

302
00:45:35,461 --> 00:45:38,321
No one wants to see your body.

303
00:45:42,575 --> 00:45:44,315
Come here, wait!

304
00:45:59,745 --> 00:46:01,495
Go inside!

305
00:48:09,237 --> 00:48:10,587
Daughter.

306
00:48:17,287 --> 00:48:19,437
May Allah bless you.

307
00:48:19,989 --> 00:48:22,419
I wish you died with your honor.

308
00:48:24,995 --> 00:48:28,545
Only at that time I could say
may Allah bless you.

309
00:48:55,676 --> 00:48:58,416
The arrow sticked in my son's heart!

310
00:49:00,980 --> 00:49:05,410
When we found the betrayer in the
tribe with Lena...

311
00:49:13,102 --> 00:49:19,442
I wish this arrow had hit your heart!

312
00:49:24,334 --> 00:49:25,994
I wish that!

313
00:49:54,412 --> 00:50:00,692
I wish I could be as strong as to
seek forgiveness from you.

314
00:50:21,753 --> 00:50:23,413
I wish I could.

315
00:51:31,773 --> 00:51:35,463
You are the disgrace of...

316
00:51:37,871 --> 00:51:39,941
Kayı Tribe.

317
00:51:49,460 --> 00:51:52,230
You are My grandfather Suleiman Shah's...

318
00:51:54,294 --> 00:51:57,914
My father Ertugrul Ghazi's shame...

319
00:52:02,347 --> 00:52:04,687
You are our broken heart.

320
00:52:15,392 --> 00:52:21,722
Your death is not going to kill
our pain...

321
00:52:24,689 --> 00:52:27,599
or relieve our hearts.

322
00:52:32,345 --> 00:52:34,825
In return of all the pain...

323
00:52:37,581 --> 00:52:40,761
This won't be enough.

324
00:52:50,845 --> 00:52:52,685
Boran.

325
00:53:34,381 --> 00:53:36,521
Osman Bey.

326
00:53:43,785 --> 00:53:45,705
Osman Bey.

327
00:53:51,378 --> 00:53:53,958
I have a last wish from you.

328
00:54:03,039 --> 00:54:08,129
Allow me to die by your hands.

329
00:54:13,925 --> 00:54:18,435
For your grandmother
Halime Hatun...

330
00:54:19,219 --> 00:54:23,779
my beautiful mother...

331
00:54:24,505 --> 00:54:28,505
don't take this away from me.

332
00:54:30,769 --> 00:54:37,449
I don't deserve to be strangled
like an honorable bey.

333
00:54:41,134 --> 00:54:45,524
Don't give me this honor.

334
00:54:54,236 --> 00:54:58,236
That arrow which took Bayhoca's
life...

335
00:55:00,889 --> 00:55:04,889
should take mine as well.

336
00:55:16,214 --> 00:55:20,094
Is this your last word?

337
00:55:22,830 --> 00:55:26,830
The day I took refuge in Nikola...

338
00:55:26,830 --> 00:55:31,690
I saw the map of Söğüt
on the table.

339
00:55:31,906 --> 00:55:36,386
They were making war plans
with Kalanoz.

340
00:55:38,986 --> 00:55:42,986
There is more, my nephew.

341
00:55:42,986 --> 00:55:46,986
They dug under Söğüt like
moles.

342
00:55:48,961 --> 00:55:54,751
Don't lose the Söğüt that my
brother conquered to the heathens.

343
00:55:55,584 --> 00:55:59,584
Don't.

344
00:57:36,539 --> 00:57:43,439
Savcı Bey. Keep the word you
gave to Lena.

345
00:58:02,211 --> 00:58:05,881
Osman Bey.

346
00:58:12,018 --> 00:58:16,018
Give me your blessing.

347
00:58:51,560 --> 00:58:54,660
Daughter...

348
00:58:56,754 --> 00:59:00,124
Aygül...

349
01:00:03,837 --> 01:00:12,487
May Allah forgive your sins.

350
01:00:55,657 --> 01:01:01,307
I bear witness that there is no
god but Allah...

351
01:01:04,516 --> 01:01:10,326
and I bear witness that Muhammad is...

352
01:01:10,326 --> 01:01:14,086
the servant and Messenger of Allah.

353
01:05:39,343 --> 01:05:43,343
Dündar Bey is dead.

354
01:05:43,343 --> 01:05:49,843
If our agreement still stands,
let us go.

355
01:05:58,557 --> 01:06:03,037
You gave your word!
You gave your word!

356
01:06:03,037 --> 01:06:06,337
You would honor our agreement!

357
01:06:06,337 --> 01:06:11,497
You promised to answer all my
questions right.

358
01:06:14,042 --> 01:06:20,952
So we did. We answered all your
questions correctly, Osman Bey.

359
01:06:20,952 --> 01:06:24,952
What about the ones I didn't ask?

360
01:06:27,934 --> 01:06:32,494
Of course, we aren't responsible
of them.

361
01:06:32,858 --> 01:06:36,858
But, an agreement is an agreement.

362
01:06:36,858 --> 01:06:40,858
I'll have another question.

363
01:06:43,613 --> 01:06:46,683
Togay.

364
01:06:47,033 --> 01:06:53,053
How did he enter the inn when he
attacked Umur Bey?

365
01:07:02,869 --> 01:07:06,869
An agreement is an agreement.

366
01:07:06,869 --> 01:07:11,419
You trusted me and I trusted you.

367
01:07:13,997 --> 01:07:18,837
Now give me the true answer.

368
01:07:18,837 --> 01:07:24,527
If you keep silent for what you know,
the agreement goes off.

369
01:07:26,486 --> 01:07:34,836
There was no entrance to the inn from
the door, window, or roof.

370
01:07:35,909 --> 01:07:41,819
Now tell me.
How did Togay enter the inn?

371
01:07:42,706 --> 01:07:45,556
Petros?

372
01:07:53,690 --> 01:07:59,520
-Tell me.
-The tunnel!

373
01:08:02,713 --> 01:08:07,393
The secret tunnel that we dug from
the store to the inn.

374
01:08:07,393 --> 01:08:10,563
Tunnel, huh?

375
01:08:14,837 --> 01:08:18,837
How many tunnels are there?

376
01:08:19,899 --> 01:08:22,939
How many tunnels are there?

377
01:08:22,939 --> 01:08:30,339
To the church, to the macellum, and to
the inn. There are three big tunnels.

378
01:08:32,261 --> 01:08:39,251
Is that so? Does Nikola know the
tunnels?

379
01:08:39,449 --> 01:08:43,449
He knows it.

380
01:08:47,427 --> 01:08:52,867
Come on. Let's see these tunnels.

381
01:09:10,777 --> 01:09:14,777
We searched every corner
of the shop.

382
01:09:14,777 --> 01:09:20,197
But even the devil would fail to find
the secret passage.

383
01:09:24,752 --> 01:09:29,792
-Where does this lead to?
-Directly to the inn.

384
01:09:30,494 --> 01:09:35,844
So, Togay came through here
to attack Umur Bey.

385
01:09:37,631 --> 01:09:41,631
The tunnel separates into two
ways.

386
01:09:41,631 --> 01:09:45,631
One to the church, other
to the macellum.

387
01:09:45,895 --> 01:09:52,405
Then, Nikola would use these tunnels
to attack Söğüt.

388
01:09:52,405 --> 01:09:54,485
Yes.

389
01:09:56,259 --> 01:10:00,259
Kalanoz comes for this reason.

390
01:10:00,259 --> 01:10:06,389
-He will attack Söğüt.
-If we hadn't found this, it'd be bad.

391
01:10:06,444 --> 01:10:12,264
Not only Söğüt, Göktuğ.
They would even attack the tribe.

392
01:10:15,718 --> 01:10:21,118
Now tell me, when will they attack?

393
01:10:21,118 --> 01:10:27,018
-We don't know.
-We aren't informed either.

394
01:10:27,018 --> 01:10:31,458
They will contact you when they attack,
will they not?

395
01:10:35,927 --> 01:10:40,837
Now tell me, who will contact you?

396
01:10:40,837 --> 01:10:43,747
Helen.

397
01:10:50,573 --> 01:10:55,543
You have one last task to survive.

398
01:11:08,272 --> 01:11:11,992
After Togay killed my brother,
trade nearly stopped.

399
01:11:11,992 --> 01:11:16,272
As a shepherd, you have to feed
your herd.

400
01:11:16,272 --> 01:11:21,972
If you can't, they won't listen to you.
Not only that...

401
01:11:22,619 --> 01:11:28,629
they will crush you.

402
01:11:28,912 --> 01:11:32,462
How? I can't even feed my soldiers.

403
01:11:32,462 --> 01:11:36,912
You will provoke both your soldiers
and your merchants.

404
01:11:36,912 --> 01:11:42,352
You will make them believe in the crusade
with gold and war.

405
01:11:42,352 --> 01:11:46,542
I don't have the power to fight
or gold to give, Nikola!

406
01:11:57,373 --> 01:12:02,833
What would happen if you
gave your tax to your soldiers...

407
01:12:02,833 --> 01:12:07,493
instead of the Seljuks?

408
01:12:09,270 --> 01:12:13,270
Won't Geyhatu make me pay for it?

409
01:12:14,295 --> 01:12:21,605
When we take Söğüt, all the dominance
of the Turks in Bythnia will end!

410
01:12:22,053 --> 01:12:27,563
Geyhatu have so much trouble that
he won't come to our borders.

411
01:12:27,894 --> 01:12:31,164
Isn't that so?

412
01:12:32,542 --> 01:12:37,922
And you keep talking about your
brother's vengeance!

413
01:12:37,922 --> 01:12:43,882
And I talked to the emperor to convince
him to make you a lord.

414
01:12:43,882 --> 01:12:46,682
-If you don't have the courage--
-Nikola!

415
01:12:48,166 --> 01:12:52,596
Tell me what I can do for you,
for our victory!

416
01:13:08,113 --> 01:13:13,503
Pray. You can pray for me.

417
01:13:18,794 --> 01:13:21,254
And also...

418
01:13:25,388 --> 01:13:29,388
I need your best archers.

419
01:13:30,886 --> 01:13:34,886
-Is that all?
-That's all.

420
01:13:34,886 --> 01:13:38,256
My soldiers are in your order
from tomorrow, Nikola.

421
01:13:38,256 --> 01:13:42,886
May God watch over you, Yaso the Brave.

422
01:14:11,998 --> 01:14:15,998
I'll take care of you right away.

423
01:14:28,353 --> 01:14:32,353
Where is Dündar?

424
01:14:32,439 --> 01:14:35,149
I don't know.

425
01:14:35,149 --> 01:14:39,149
What did you talk about when
you visited him at the castle?

426
01:14:39,149 --> 01:14:43,739
He asked me about Hazal Hatun.
Osman banished her.

427
01:14:43,843 --> 01:14:49,403
-Where is Hazal now?
-With his brother at Çobanoğulları, I guess.

428
01:14:49,403 --> 01:14:56,113
Dündar would probably learn this and
go after his wife already.

429
01:14:56,113 --> 01:15:00,113
What about Petros?
Where is Petros?

430
01:15:00,113 --> 01:15:04,113
He didn't return from İznik yet.
But he'll come tomorrow.

431
01:15:05,424 --> 01:15:09,424
Why are you asking that?

432
01:15:09,424 --> 01:15:14,624
Is is the big day?

433
01:15:17,697 --> 01:15:21,697
The war of Söğüt...

434
01:15:22,125 --> 01:15:27,105
-When?
-Tomorrow.

435
01:15:28,026 --> 01:15:32,026
Good. Good. Very good.

436
01:15:32,550 --> 01:15:38,890
Now, I'll tell you how you will help
our soldiers infiltrate.

437
01:15:38,890 --> 01:15:44,950
We'll do what's necessary when
Petros returns tonight. Don't worry.

438
01:15:44,950 --> 01:15:48,950
Open your ears and listen to me good.

439
01:15:55,645 --> 01:15:59,645
The heathens are getting bolder.

440
01:15:59,645 --> 01:16:03,645
They think that we are unaware.

441
01:16:03,645 --> 01:16:11,285
Now, we'll talk about the measures we'll
take and the blows we'll strike.

442
01:16:12,285 --> 01:16:19,695
Osman Bey, we need to stop Nikola's
soldiers before entering the tunnels.

443
01:16:19,695 --> 01:16:25,305
We can strike them with a sudden
raid and evade the danger.

444
01:16:25,305 --> 01:16:33,335
After all, if they enter the tunnel, we
can't know who kills who in chaos.

445
01:16:33,335 --> 01:16:37,905
Thank you, Bamsı Bey. I don't want
them in Söğüt.

446
01:16:37,905 --> 01:16:42,776
We can hurt Nikola's army well if we
attack them in the open with our cavalry.

447
01:16:44,820 --> 01:16:50,910
We killed the traitor in the tribe but
we should be careful.

448
01:16:50,910 --> 01:16:54,910
It might be false news.

449
01:16:57,423 --> 01:17:02,973
Osman Bey, what say you?
What's on your mind?

450
01:17:05,217 --> 01:17:10,497
-May I enter, my bey?
-Come.

451
01:17:15,835 --> 01:17:21,385
My bey, Melik returned, has important news.
-Let him come.

452
01:17:41,730 --> 01:17:45,730
-Tell me what you heard.
-Helen.

453
01:17:46,094 --> 01:17:50,694
She came to the store.
They'll attack tomorrow.

454
01:17:50,694 --> 01:17:54,694
There is little time.

455
01:17:58,908 --> 01:18:04,448
-How will they attack?
-A part of the soldiers...

456
01:18:04,448 --> 01:18:08,448
will enter through the tunnels.

457
01:18:08,448 --> 01:18:12,448
Kalanos will attack at the gates
of Söğüt.

458
01:18:22,381 --> 01:18:28,471
Tomorrow, we'll know if you lied
to us or not.

459
01:18:28,471 --> 01:18:33,651
Osman Bey, a lie that will
last until tomorow...

460
01:18:33,651 --> 01:18:36,261
can do me no good.

461
01:18:42,270 --> 01:18:46,780
Göktuğ. Take him away.

462
01:18:59,361 --> 01:19:03,361
Both Kalanos and Nikola.

463
01:19:04,099 --> 01:19:08,939
Both from the tunnels and
the city gates.

464
01:19:12,492 --> 01:19:18,772
In such a short time, how will we
defend both, Osman Bey?

465
01:19:20,605 --> 01:19:26,605
Bamsı Bey, what would my father
Ertuğrul Ghazi say?

466
01:19:29,003 --> 01:19:36,353
He would say that a game set so easy
is difficult to break.

467
01:19:36,814 --> 01:19:41,874
But it is easy to break a game
that is set too difficult.

468
01:19:47,768 --> 01:19:50,818
This...

469
01:19:57,240 --> 01:20:03,020
This will be a difficult game.

470
01:20:05,925 --> 01:20:10,175
Osman Bey is free from the hump
on his back.

471
01:20:12,207 --> 01:20:17,097
He finally killed the traitor
in his tribe.

472
01:20:17,097 --> 01:20:22,137
Thank Allah. Now, Osman Bey will stand
stronger against the heathens.

473
01:20:28,371 --> 01:20:34,541
Not only against the heathens but
also against us.

474
01:20:34,761 --> 01:20:40,701
Isn't that what we wanted? A strong ally
that we can trust.

475
01:20:40,701 --> 01:20:45,501
Of course, but don't forget that...

476
01:20:45,501 --> 01:20:50,591
as Osman Bey gets stronger, his
demands will grow.

477
01:20:55,914 --> 01:21:01,004
Now, we need to do something big.

478
01:21:01,004 --> 01:21:07,094
We should so that he'll understand that
Kızılbeyoğulları isn't an easy game.

479
01:21:07,094 --> 01:21:10,534
What's on your mind, my bey father?

480
01:21:10,534 --> 01:21:15,094
I will send a new caravan to İnegöl.

481
01:21:15,094 --> 01:21:20,874
We'll infiltrate the grooms to the castle!
-Not yet, Malhun. Not yet.

482
01:21:23,378 --> 01:21:27,378
For now, our trade should continue.

483
01:21:27,378 --> 01:21:31,378
We should gain Nikola's trust as
much as possible.

484
01:21:31,378 --> 01:21:35,378
So that he won't be suspicious
of anything.

485
01:21:36,595 --> 01:21:40,595
-May I enter, my bey?
-Come!

486
01:21:44,475 --> 01:21:50,635
My bey, Osman Bey wants to speak.
He invites you to his tent.

487
01:21:51,505 --> 01:21:56,005
Here, he'll start counting
his demands.

488
01:21:56,427 --> 01:22:03,577
-What will we do, my bey?
-Go and find out what he wants.

489
01:22:03,577 --> 01:22:07,227
As you order, my bey.

490
01:22:11,724 --> 01:22:15,724
There will be no one but the guard
alps in the tribe.

491
01:22:15,724 --> 01:22:19,724
We'll strike our last blow with
the raid on the tribe.

492
01:22:20,406 --> 01:22:24,406
It's time to avenge my brother!

493
01:22:26,085 --> 01:22:29,015
Nikola?

494
01:22:29,424 --> 01:22:33,424
Are you still troubled.

495
01:22:34,771 --> 01:22:41,471
Something is wrong. I can see it.
I won't feel relieved before Helen comes.

496
01:22:43,613 --> 01:22:48,623
Helen?
Tell me you have good news.

497
01:22:49,137 --> 01:22:54,577
-Everything is fine, Nikola.
-What did Melik talk about with Dündar?

498
01:22:54,577 --> 01:22:59,627
They talked about Hazal. Osman sent
Dündar's wife to her brother.

499
01:22:59,627 --> 01:23:05,457
-That's probably where Dündar goes.
-Good. I would like him stay in Kastamonu.

500
01:23:05,457 --> 01:23:09,457
So that he can work for me when
the time comes.

501
01:23:11,632 --> 01:23:15,632
Helen, what about the tunnels?
Do they know what to do?

502
01:23:15,632 --> 01:23:20,092
I told them what to do when the time
comes. They are as impatient as us.

503
01:23:20,536 --> 01:23:24,536
They are still after the settling
documents.

504
01:23:24,536 --> 01:23:29,166
After what I will do, there won't be a
single Turk left in these lands.

505
01:23:30,002 --> 01:23:33,392
Not a single Turk.

506
01:23:34,084 --> 01:23:38,084
-May I enter, Osman Bey?
-Come.

507
01:23:47,895 --> 01:23:53,905
-Welcome, Malhun Hatun.
-Thank you, Osman Bey. Father sent regards.

508
01:23:53,905 --> 01:23:58,445
-He couldn't come because he was busy.
-Aleikum Salam.

509
01:23:59,202 --> 01:24:03,202
I know what he is busy with.

510
01:24:04,092 --> 01:24:10,262
You are preparing a new caravan to
sent Nikola.

511
01:24:10,262 --> 01:24:16,042
Don't worry, Osman Bey. We aren't
selling horses to Nikola.

512
01:24:16,042 --> 01:24:21,192
I know that. That's not why
I invited you.

513
01:24:29,814 --> 01:24:33,814
-Here.
-Allah bless you.

514
01:24:35,470 --> 01:24:39,470
What is Osman Bey talking to
that woman?

515
01:24:42,037 --> 01:24:47,817
Who knows, Bala? Maybe they did something
bad and he is questioning him.

516
01:24:54,555 --> 01:24:58,065
-Here.
-Allah bless you.

517
01:24:58,450 --> 01:25:02,450
This woman will bring such trouble that...

518
01:25:02,717 --> 01:25:06,717
we'll miss Dündar Bey.

519
01:25:08,314 --> 01:25:12,314
-Here.
-Allah bless you.

520
01:25:23,086 --> 01:25:27,086
You were faultier at that...

521
01:25:27,086 --> 01:25:31,086
but it was corrected.

522
01:25:31,086 --> 01:25:35,526
You were faultier to hide
the thumb ring too...

523
01:25:35,526 --> 01:25:38,345
but it was also corrected.

524
01:25:38,345 --> 01:25:44,364
Now, there is a chance to redeem
the mistakes.

525
01:25:46,353 --> 01:25:53,223
I want you to lead the caravan
to İnegöl.

526
01:25:57,053 --> 01:26:01,053
Have you started to trust me, Osman Bey?

527
01:26:04,615 --> 01:26:08,615
Trust can't be broken twice, you said.

528
01:26:10,047 --> 01:26:13,717
Don't break my trust.

529
01:26:13,717 --> 01:26:20,427
I'm happy to see you haven't forgotten it.
Continue before forgetting yours.

530
01:26:21,445 --> 01:26:28,055
There is something very valuable that
I want you to bring from İnegöl.

531
01:27:19,443 --> 01:27:23,443
I avenged our warriors, Togay.

532
01:27:23,443 --> 01:27:27,443
-What about Kalanoz?
-He ran away.

533
01:27:27,443 --> 01:27:32,103
Osman slaughtered his army.
Then I slaughtered what was left.

534
01:27:34,865 --> 01:27:39,215
Geyhatu made you the Noyan
of the borders.

535
01:27:39,215 --> 01:27:45,075
We are ready to die for revenge,
for you, Togay.

536
01:27:45,075 --> 01:27:50,235
Revenge will wait for a while.

537
01:27:50,857 --> 01:27:57,017
Firstly, we'll go after the taxes that
lords should pay to Seljuks.

538
01:27:57,497 --> 01:28:01,497
We'll start with the lord of Yarhisar.

539
01:28:01,497 --> 01:28:09,047
The Emperor appointed his brother Yaso in
the place of the lord I killed.

540
01:28:09,310 --> 01:28:13,890
He left the castle to hunt.

541
01:28:13,890 --> 01:28:18,970
If he is hunting...

542
01:28:20,370 --> 01:28:23,650
let's claw him there.

543
01:28:40,301 --> 01:28:44,301
With the name of Allah.

544
01:28:44,301 --> 01:28:48,051
Mashallah. Mashallah.

545
01:28:52,528 --> 01:28:56,238
Allah bless you.

546
01:28:56,238 --> 01:28:59,298
Mashallah. Mashallah.

547
01:28:59,590 --> 01:29:03,590
-Salam Alaikum.
-Alaikum Salam, Kumral Abdal.

548
01:29:16,537 --> 01:29:22,637
Kumral Abdal, I've been giving out food for
hours but there still are so many. Weird.

549
01:29:24,564 --> 01:29:30,734
Pehlivan Dervish, Akça Dervish decreases
it and Sheikh Edebali increases it.

550
01:29:36,967 --> 01:29:41,797
-Salam Alaikum.
-Alaikum Salam, Osman Bey.

551
01:29:53,329 --> 01:29:57,329
Kumral Abdal.

552
01:29:57,548 --> 01:30:01,078
I want to see Sheikh Edebali.

553
01:30:01,078 --> 01:30:04,738
Who wouldn't, Osman Bey?

554
01:30:07,555 --> 01:30:12,155
You gave me peace in my
most difficult times.

555
01:30:14,093 --> 01:30:19,183
Don't you worry about losing
your place in me.

556
01:30:25,045 --> 01:30:30,415
Your heart is wide, Osman Bey.
We aren't afraid.

557
01:30:36,737 --> 01:30:40,737
-Come.
-Thank you.

558
01:30:55,620 --> 01:30:59,620
-Salam Alaikum.
-Alaikum Salam.

559
01:31:09,639 --> 01:31:13,639
With the name of Allah.

560
01:31:18,324 --> 01:31:24,334
-Salam Alaikum.
-Alaikum Salam, Osman Bey.

561
01:31:28,364 --> 01:31:32,364
Come.

562
01:32:03,537 --> 01:32:06,457
My Sheikh.

563
01:32:09,287 --> 01:32:12,807
My uncle...

564
01:32:13,102 --> 01:32:17,102
my father's brother...

565
01:32:22,642 --> 01:32:26,642
How could my uncle do such a thing?

566
01:32:29,389 --> 01:32:35,449
Dündar Bey was a good trader,
was he not, Osman Bey?

567
01:32:39,197 --> 01:32:42,817
True. True, my sheikh.

568
01:32:42,817 --> 01:32:48,077
Who else's uncle was
also a trader?

569
01:32:49,673 --> 01:32:56,243
Do you remember someone who
was insulted by his uncle?

570
01:32:56,415 --> 01:33:03,225
His uncle was putting tripe
next to his door.

571
01:33:06,712 --> 01:33:12,852
He would stone his house.
He would leave him hungry.

572
01:33:14,492 --> 01:33:21,232
Who had suffered such an uncle, Osman Bey?

573
01:33:25,013 --> 01:33:29,473
Our prophet, may he rest in peace.

574
01:33:33,298 --> 01:33:39,668
It's our prophet. And his uncle is the
one...

575
01:33:39,779 --> 01:33:47,419
who was cursed in Qur-an,
Ebu Leheb.

576
01:33:50,229 --> 01:33:55,620
So, what did our prophet do?

577
01:33:56,692 --> 01:34:01,152
He kept patient and continued
in his path.

578
01:34:01,152 --> 01:34:05,152
He was patient and he walked
in his path.

579
01:34:05,152 --> 01:34:12,292
He suffered the insults, slanders
and tyranny of his uncle Ebu Leheb...

580
01:34:12,292 --> 01:34:19,541
and many other relatives he had.

581
01:34:19,616 --> 01:34:23,616
But he continued on his path.

582
01:34:24,547 --> 01:34:32,707
Even if you give me the sun and
the moon...

583
01:34:34,963 --> 01:34:39,613
I won't return from my way, he said.

584
01:34:39,613 --> 01:34:43,613
After all, that's Allah's path.

585
01:34:43,613 --> 01:34:51,773
And Allah choose Muhammad Mustafa
to spread his religion...

586
01:34:53,204 --> 01:34:58,114
and to teach the right way to
the people.

587
01:34:58,114 --> 01:35:03,004
Is it possible to turn back from this
path, Osman Bey?

588
01:35:03,004 --> 01:35:09,714
My sheikh, our prophet
didn't return.

589
01:35:11,959 --> 01:35:17,989
He crowned his faith
with the victory of Islam.

590
01:35:19,537 --> 01:35:25,737
As the soldiers of this cause...

591
01:35:26,797 --> 01:35:30,797
we won't turn back either.

592
01:35:30,797 --> 01:35:38,857
Osman Bey, of course, none of
us will put us in his place.

593
01:35:38,857 --> 01:35:44,197
Not at all.
Not at all, my sheikh.

594
01:35:44,197 --> 01:35:48,917
And we should know that...

595
01:35:48,917 --> 01:35:53,769
none of us will have his
value for Allah.

596
01:35:53,769 --> 01:35:58,009
Not at all.
Not at all.

597
01:35:59,144 --> 01:36:03,144
But we will emulate him...

598
01:36:03,144 --> 01:36:07,144
and try to be like him.

599
01:36:07,144 --> 01:36:14,284
We'll be patient and be on our path,
Osman Bey.

600
01:36:16,315 --> 01:36:22,245
You should consider your uncle's
treason in this way.

601
01:36:22,803 --> 01:36:26,093
Thank you, my sheikh.

602
01:36:26,631 --> 01:36:30,340
Thank you.

603
01:36:30,340 --> 01:36:36,020
Walk as our prophet did in Allah's
cause.

604
01:36:36,472 --> 01:36:42,312
That's what the people and history
expects from you.

605
01:36:42,972 --> 01:36:49,642
Until my last breath,
this is my cause...

606
01:36:49,642 --> 01:36:53,642
and this is my path.

607
01:36:54,351 --> 01:36:58,181
Thank you, Osman Bey.

608
01:37:30,305 --> 01:37:34,295
Deliver the goods.

609
01:37:52,944 --> 01:37:59,464
-My lady, where are we going?
-Be patient. Let's find it.

610
01:37:59,464 --> 01:38:02,164
What will we find?

611
01:38:10,123 --> 01:38:13,143
We already found it.

612
01:38:13,143 --> 01:38:17,123
My lady, what's there?

613
01:38:18,221 --> 01:38:22,221
Now, listen to me well.

614
01:38:44,007 --> 01:38:49,917
Finally, let's see you, pig.
We have a feast tonight.

615
01:38:59,367 --> 01:39:01,107
Mongols!

616
01:39:17,557 --> 01:39:22,707
How could that be?
I swear that I hit a pig!

617
01:39:23,887 --> 01:39:28,307
I'm the lord of Yarhisar.
Who are you? What do you want?

618
01:39:44,819 --> 01:39:48,819
-Who are you?
-Togay.

619
01:39:52,559 --> 01:39:58,609
I'm Togay the Dark Shaman,
border Noyan of Geyhatu.

620
01:40:05,424 --> 01:40:11,064
I heard that Osman killed your poor
brother.

621
01:40:29,413 --> 01:40:34,093
You protected his throne.
May spirits protect him.

622
01:40:34,093 --> 01:40:38,923
Thank you, Togay.
What do you want from me?

623
01:40:47,240 --> 01:40:53,030
You delayed your tax
for the Seljuks.

624
01:40:53,030 --> 01:40:58,010
Seljuks means Geyhatu.
Don't you know that?

625
01:41:00,120 --> 01:41:06,340
We had my brother's funeral.
I'm hoping that you'll be understanding.

626
01:41:06,624 --> 01:41:10,214
We'll send the taxes to Konya
in a few days.

627
01:41:10,214 --> 01:41:15,714
This would be great.
I don't want your father to lose...

628
01:41:15,714 --> 01:41:19,814
another son after your brother.

629
01:41:19,814 --> 01:41:25,604
-Be quick.
-Like I said. In a few days.

630
01:41:27,994 --> 01:41:32,704
Camuha. Take out the pig from
where you hid it.

631
01:41:32,704 --> 01:41:37,994
Give it to the lord.
Even though I hit it.

632
01:41:39,214 --> 01:41:42,714
It will be my gift.

633
01:41:43,295 --> 01:41:47,295
-Bring it.
-Did I not hit it?

634
01:41:47,295 --> 01:41:52,295
It's my little gift for you.

635
01:41:54,404 --> 01:41:58,404
I will never forget this goodness.

636
01:42:13,445 --> 01:42:17,745
Soon, you'll die, murderer.

637
01:42:20,881 --> 01:42:24,571
-Will he pay his taxes?
-No.

638
01:42:24,571 --> 01:42:30,301
-He wouldn't dare.
-He trusts Nikola. He knows I killed his brother.

639
01:42:30,301 --> 01:42:35,021
He couldn't even speak out of his fear.
He'll kill me at first chance.

640
01:42:36,016 --> 01:42:39,426
What will we do?

641
01:42:39,426 --> 01:42:44,016
We'll set an unexpected great bonfire.

642
01:42:44,360 --> 01:42:49,310
The dark nights of Bhytinia will
turn into a fireball.

643
01:43:09,011 --> 01:43:14,921
-I told you to not come this way.
-It's because of you!

644
01:43:16,892 --> 01:43:20,892
-Idiot!
-Are you talking to me?

645
01:43:21,421 --> 01:43:24,591
Let's top these idiots.

646
01:43:28,865 --> 01:43:32,865
-Come on, now is the time.
-How will we open the door?

647
01:43:34,380 --> 01:43:38,380
If luck smiles upon us, it won't
be too hard.

648
01:43:40,665 --> 01:43:44,365
-Who are you?
-We are Umur Bey's men.

649
01:43:44,365 --> 01:43:50,465
We brought the goods Lord Nikola wanted.
It's all because of him!

650
01:43:57,194 --> 01:44:01,194
It's all because of him!
All because of him!

651
01:44:10,449 --> 01:44:14,449
-Come here!
-It's your fault!

652
01:44:15,882 --> 01:44:19,882
-Close it!
-My lady!

653
01:44:19,882 --> 01:44:23,532
Tell me, what are we doing here?

654
01:44:23,532 --> 01:44:26,852
Osman Bey was right.

655
01:44:27,563 --> 01:44:30,603
What do you want from İnegöl Castle,
Osman Bey?

656
01:44:30,603 --> 01:44:36,093
Flame barrels. Nikola hides them
in a secret place in İnegöl.

657
01:44:37,480 --> 01:44:41,480
How do you know that he hides
them there?

658
01:44:48,296 --> 01:44:52,296
The late Zülfikar Dervish...

659
01:44:52,296 --> 01:44:56,296
prepared this before
passing away.

660
01:44:57,131 --> 01:45:01,131
This will take you to the
flame barrels.

661
01:45:02,116 --> 01:45:06,116
But the rest is on you.

662
01:45:07,030 --> 01:45:11,030
So, you trust me this much.

663
01:45:12,155 --> 01:45:17,345
I invite you to jihad.
I give you opportunity.

664
01:45:18,763 --> 01:45:22,763
I want to see what you will do.

665
01:45:31,812 --> 01:45:35,812
I won't make you regret that,
Osman Bey.

666
01:45:38,229 --> 01:45:41,989
Thank you.

667
01:46:01,114 --> 01:46:05,904
We'll take as much as we can
carry and leave.

668
01:46:39,198 --> 01:46:45,738
-There are two of them. Let's kill them.
-Wait. Their corpses will be found.

669
01:46:45,738 --> 01:46:50,358
Then, they'll notice that the
flame barrels are missing.

670
01:47:00,619 --> 01:47:04,319
Hurry! We need help at the market.

671
01:47:04,715 --> 01:47:08,715
No one will leave until the crowd
leaves.

672
01:47:15,713 --> 01:47:19,463
We can't use the door.
We are stuck here.

673
01:47:19,463 --> 01:47:23,443
Don't be so sure.

674
01:47:29,402 --> 01:47:35,312
We will leave here.
Check the door while I open the lock.

675
01:48:11,353 --> 01:48:15,023
There isn't a traitor here in
your tent anymore.

676
01:48:21,023 --> 01:48:25,863
You will stop Nikola's attack and
you will protect Söğüt, my Osman Bey.

677
01:48:27,223 --> 01:48:29,693
Inshallah, my Bala.
Inshallah.

678
01:48:29,804 --> 01:48:32,044
May Allah help us.

679
01:48:32,453 --> 01:48:33,713
However...

680
01:48:35,740 --> 01:48:38,940
I'm waiting
for important news from Malhun Hatun.

681
01:48:40,086 --> 01:48:43,266
What does Malhun
Hatun have to do with it?

682
01:48:44,508 --> 01:48:46,758
Can I come in, Osman Bey?

683
01:48:50,295 --> 01:48:52,235
Come in.

684
01:48:58,399 --> 01:48:59,609
Malhun Hatun.

685
01:49:18,397 --> 01:49:20,067
Mashallah.

686
01:49:20,804 --> 01:49:22,734
This is what you wanted, Osman Bey.

687
01:49:22,842 --> 01:49:26,122
We have taken the flame barrels
from the heathens.

688
01:49:34,465 --> 01:49:36,875
Mashallah.

689
01:49:40,250 --> 01:49:42,040
Mashallah.

690
01:49:48,456 --> 01:49:50,356
Malhun Hatun...

691
01:49:51,522 --> 01:49:53,942
you've done an important job.

692
01:50:00,894 --> 01:50:04,894
You showed
me that I was right to trust you.

693
01:50:12,086 --> 01:50:13,176
Thank you.

694
01:50:13,353 --> 01:50:17,073
I'm happy that you
trust me again, Osman Bey.

695
01:50:24,903 --> 01:50:27,963
I want to go to my tent if you excuse me.

696
01:50:29,524 --> 01:50:31,744
Of course.

697
01:50:32,076 --> 01:50:34,906
Send my regards to Umur Bey.

698
01:50:47,528 --> 01:50:49,058
Baysungur.

699
01:50:52,007 --> 01:50:55,437
- Yes, my Bey.
- Summon the Beys.

700
01:50:55,706 --> 01:50:57,686
Your command, my Bey.

701
01:51:05,914 --> 01:51:06,894
My Bala.

702
01:51:09,752 --> 01:51:10,962
Victory is...

703
01:51:14,357 --> 01:51:17,187
ours now.

704
01:51:43,929 --> 01:51:47,119
What were you doing in İnegöl?

705
01:51:50,737 --> 01:51:53,307
Did I ask you to go there?

706
01:51:53,386 --> 01:51:56,686
How could you do it without my permission?

707
01:51:56,805 --> 01:51:57,895
My Bey...

708
01:51:58,401 --> 01:51:59,981
Osman Bey...

709
01:52:10,253 --> 01:52:11,593
Malhun.

710
01:52:12,461 --> 01:52:16,581
Did I ask you to take the helm
of the caravan?

711
01:52:16,796 --> 01:52:19,336
Did I tell you to go to İnegöl?

712
01:52:19,742 --> 01:52:22,932
- Osman Bey wanted me to.
- What do you mean?

713
01:52:23,014 --> 01:52:25,044
Why?

714
01:52:25,347 --> 01:52:28,757
Nikola wants to kill everyone in Söğüt.

715
01:52:30,222 --> 01:52:31,092
How?

716
01:52:31,264 --> 01:52:35,604
They dig tunnels. They will send
soldiers to the city.

717
01:52:35,643 --> 01:52:37,803
What do you have to do with this?

718
01:52:38,075 --> 01:52:41,315
Osman Bey wanted me to go to İnegöl.

719
01:52:41,435 --> 01:52:45,435
I gave the flame barrels to Osman Bey.

720
01:52:45,640 --> 01:52:48,690
He will explode the tunnels with them.

721
01:52:49,914 --> 01:52:53,914
He once charged us with betrayal.

722
01:52:54,275 --> 01:52:58,275
Now, he wants our help.

723
01:52:58,821 --> 01:53:01,571
You did well.

724
01:53:04,426 --> 01:53:06,316
My Bey...

725
01:53:06,826 --> 01:53:10,096
I want to be with Osman Bey on
that war.

726
01:53:20,612 --> 01:53:23,352
Let me go with my Alps.

727
01:53:25,968 --> 01:53:27,808
It's okay.

728
01:53:33,368 --> 01:53:39,318
Osman Bey will understand his mistake of
keeping us apart from the wars.

729
01:53:53,366 --> 01:53:56,386
When Nikola's soldiers got into
to the tunnels...

730
01:53:56,877 --> 01:53:58,397
we will...

731
01:53:59,426 --> 01:54:00,876
fire them...

732
01:54:02,094 --> 01:54:04,924
with those flame barrels.

733
01:54:06,870 --> 01:54:10,050
The tunnels that they dug themselves...

734
01:54:10,191 --> 01:54:13,221
will be their graves.

735
01:54:15,035 --> 01:54:18,145
Mashallah.
Mashallah...

736
01:54:18,305 --> 01:54:20,125
however...

737
01:54:20,378 --> 01:54:23,028
how did you take these barrels, Osman Bey?

738
01:54:24,390 --> 01:54:26,610
Thanks to Malhun Hatun.

739
01:54:26,807 --> 01:54:29,687
Malhun Hatun.
How could she take them?

740
01:54:29,817 --> 01:54:34,647
I wanted her to do it and she brought
them from İnegöl...

741
01:54:36,210 --> 01:54:38,570
no
matter how dangerous it is.

742
01:54:38,790 --> 01:54:40,660
Thanks to her.

743
01:54:40,848 --> 01:54:45,418
How did Malhun Hatun do that?

744
01:54:46,119 --> 01:54:48,199
Sheikh Zülfikar Dervish...

745
01:54:48,359 --> 01:54:51,169
told me where the barrels were hidden.

746
01:54:51,416 --> 01:54:57,046
However, someone that Nikola wouldn't
suspect should have got them.

747
01:54:57,945 --> 01:55:01,845
He would suspect everyone.

748
01:55:02,892 --> 01:55:04,972
Mashallah.

749
01:55:05,233 --> 01:55:08,443
Malhun Hatun did a huge job.

750
01:55:08,508 --> 01:55:12,028
Now, we can attack Nikola with
his own weapon.

751
01:55:12,159 --> 01:55:14,659
They found the right way.

752
01:55:14,745 --> 01:55:20,135
Umur Bey and his tent will
make us more powerful.

753
01:55:20,360 --> 01:55:23,950
Yes.

754
01:55:32,583 --> 01:55:36,943
These tunnels have three exits.

755
01:55:38,428 --> 01:55:42,388
This exit is near Süleyman' shop.

756
01:55:42,816 --> 01:55:44,886
Melik will wait there.

757
01:55:44,996 --> 01:55:48,696
He will fire the flame barrel
when we say so.

758
01:55:48,762 --> 01:55:52,762
We will place our Alps on to the
other two exits.

759
01:55:53,304 --> 01:55:58,484
And they will catch the heathens.

760
01:56:05,212 --> 01:56:07,042
We...

761
01:56:07,530 --> 01:56:10,410
will stand against Kalanoz's army.

762
01:56:10,463 --> 01:56:13,683
When Nikola tries to take Söğüt...

763
01:56:13,729 --> 01:56:16,449
he will lose many of his soldiers.

764
01:56:17,235 --> 01:56:21,455
And the liberation of Söğüt will
make it through the İnegöl.

765
01:56:24,454 --> 01:56:27,204
Until that time...

766
01:56:27,344 --> 01:56:31,434
with Allah's help...

767
01:56:32,993 --> 01:56:36,993
Bamsı will be able to fight
with two hands.

768
01:56:37,266 --> 01:56:39,536
Inshallah.

769
01:56:39,813 --> 01:56:42,543
Let's wait for tomorrow.

770
01:57:45,128 --> 01:57:47,438
They have two commanders.

771
01:57:48,161 --> 01:57:50,441
They are heading to İnegöl.

772
01:57:52,659 --> 01:57:56,189
Nikola will conquer Söğüt.

773
01:57:56,331 --> 01:57:59,371
Geyhatu will make Söğüt headquarters.

774
01:57:59,478 --> 01:58:03,678
Our new headquarters will be İnegöl.

775
01:58:10,783 --> 01:58:12,433
What will we do?

776
01:58:12,739 --> 01:58:15,469
Let's fire the feast fire.

777
01:59:48,841 --> 01:59:50,171
I will...

778
01:59:51,391 --> 01:59:53,961
place it into the entrance.

779
01:59:55,105 --> 01:59:57,425
You will go inside and...

780
01:59:57,878 --> 02:00:02,938
fire it when I tell you so.

781
02:00:12,323 --> 02:00:16,433
I will chew you if you make a mistake.

782
02:00:18,819 --> 02:00:22,529
Then I will eat you.

783
02:00:24,701 --> 02:00:26,811
Do you understand?

784
02:00:28,188 --> 02:00:30,378
I do.

785
02:00:34,078 --> 02:00:35,528
Take it.

786
02:01:09,135 --> 02:01:11,215
Is it done, Göktuğ Alp?

787
02:01:11,459 --> 02:01:14,439
Yes, we placed them into
the tunnels, Savcı Bey.

788
02:01:14,520 --> 02:01:18,520
A flame or fire is enough for them to
become the grave of the heathens.

789
02:01:19,213 --> 02:01:22,193
The fire is our anger.

790
02:01:23,340 --> 02:01:25,610
Tell Osman Bey.

791
02:01:34,370 --> 02:01:36,600
Commander Kalanoz.

792
02:01:36,850 --> 02:01:41,450
I can't wait to be welcomed
by my own people in Söğüt.

793
02:01:41,844 --> 02:01:46,124
No one will be able to stop
our army in front of the castle.

794
02:01:46,548 --> 02:01:50,868
Where are Lord Yaso's archers?
Are they outside the castle?

795
02:01:51,070 --> 02:01:53,580
They didn't show up, Nikola.

796
02:02:21,515 --> 02:02:22,665
Sir.

797
02:02:27,065 --> 02:02:29,125
Talk, soldier.

798
02:02:30,557 --> 02:02:34,397
Our soldiers found this near
the castle.

799
02:02:37,073 --> 02:02:38,373
What's this?

800
02:02:46,823 --> 02:02:48,143
Open it.

801
02:02:54,436 --> 02:02:56,466
Damn it.

802
02:02:56,761 --> 02:02:59,161
This is Yaso's commander.

803
02:03:00,860 --> 02:03:02,850
Did Osman do that?

804
02:03:05,286 --> 02:03:08,336
Togay did this.

805
02:03:09,935 --> 02:03:11,805
Bring my horse.

806
02:03:14,240 --> 02:03:16,150
Bring my horse!

807
02:03:39,870 --> 02:03:42,600
I sent Nikola his gift.

808
02:03:53,161 --> 02:03:55,361
Please don't kill me.

809
02:03:56,668 --> 02:03:59,298
Send his head too.

810
02:04:03,158 --> 02:04:05,678
Can they conquer Söğüt, Togay?

811
02:04:05,877 --> 02:04:09,877
The mountains, the lands and the inns...

812
02:04:10,102 --> 02:04:14,302
belong to Geyhatu, right?

813
02:04:14,933 --> 02:04:18,623
Osman and Nikola will understand that...

814
02:04:18,732 --> 02:04:21,682
Geyhatu rules these lands.

815
02:04:25,935 --> 02:04:29,065
It will be too late for them.

816
02:05:59,966 --> 02:06:01,556
Come.

817
02:06:02,302 --> 02:06:04,852
Cerkutay's fire is waiting for you.

818
02:08:56,855 --> 02:08:58,495
Now.

819
02:09:27,537 --> 02:09:28,607
My Bey.

820
02:09:28,677 --> 02:09:32,457
Nikola's army is coming. They look
dreaded.

821
02:09:36,442 --> 02:09:40,022
We saw many dreaded.

822
02:09:41,439 --> 02:09:43,339
They...

823
02:09:43,834 --> 02:09:46,794
were buried in their own hollows.

824
02:09:56,333 --> 02:09:57,753
Alps!

825
02:09:57,922 --> 02:10:00,772
You all know what to do!

826
02:10:02,078 --> 02:10:04,698
Today is the day!

827
02:10:05,702 --> 02:10:09,142
May Allah help us!

828
02:10:09,177 --> 02:10:10,377
Amin!

829
02:10:10,443 --> 02:10:12,553
Come on!

830
02:10:30,813 --> 02:10:32,603
Come on!

831
02:10:56,965 --> 02:10:58,025
Sir.

832
02:10:58,481 --> 02:11:01,401
- What?
- The soldiers got into the tunnels.

833
02:11:01,553 --> 02:11:04,453
- The attack is about to start.
- Nice.

834
02:11:05,501 --> 02:11:09,831
Honor your own name, my God!
Not us, not us.

835
02:11:10,335 --> 02:11:12,565
Our victory is for you.

836
02:11:14,022 --> 02:11:17,532
I won't share this honor
with anyone, Kalanoz.

837
02:11:18,052 --> 02:11:22,812
You will trap Osman and his Alps
when they leave their tent.

838
02:11:23,469 --> 02:11:25,829
May the honor of victory be yours, Nikola.

839
02:11:25,925 --> 02:11:30,185
I just want to kill Osman and
take my brother's revenge.

840
02:12:26,376 --> 02:12:27,426
Osman!

841
02:12:27,568 --> 02:12:29,578
Damn it!

842
02:12:38,352 --> 02:12:42,352
How does he know that we will attack?

843
02:12:43,022 --> 02:12:45,592
What if he knows about the tunnels?

844
02:12:45,821 --> 02:12:49,421
He would destroy them by now if he knew.

845
02:12:52,573 --> 02:12:57,593
Our soldiers will head into Söğüt by the
tunnels when we are fighting here.

846
02:13:11,402 --> 02:13:13,052
Soldiers!

847
02:13:13,485 --> 02:13:15,395
Battle order!

848
02:14:27,331 --> 02:14:32,151
- Allahu Akbar!
- Allahu Akbar!

849
02:14:36,094 --> 02:14:56,574
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com